{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HOPSHOT is a difficult precision platformer about a lonely gay frog with a gun. Plan your routes, discover the secrets, and destroy anything in your way to make your Wish come true! Or fail and join the lost souls at the bottom of The Wishing Well for eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tired of other similar games being too easy? HOPSHOT's purposefully simplistic movement system allows for a brand new way to play a rage platformer: strategy &amp; planning ahead are key!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Controls: Jumping, Aiming, &amp; Shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret frog colors and hats to discover!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495790/extras/secrets.gif?t=1742324771\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change trajectory Mid-air!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495790/extras/jump.gif?t=1742324771\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Auto-saving for every jump!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495790/extras/autosave.gif?t=1742324771\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And a silly little frog named Hop Skotch!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Growth of Regret","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3495790/989ba063ead447b5b6f61b8f94f8c0b4bee777ff.jpg"},{"name":"The Shrouded Desires","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3495790/6d9b3a6073f4039c634edaa3b54f8fb85a3e8376.jpg"},{"name":"The Hidden Consequences","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3495790/6e360416ed49e4b2dbfb038895fd1c0f6508dce1